"P3792840904" "Teleport Suppressor"
// DetailString :
"P2764069182" "This is a device created by Arachnos capable of shorting out Trapdoor's long-range teleportation abilities."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL9_GV_Grillo_Mini_Arc_3_Souvenir 
