"P2084017852" "Trapdoor won't get away this time. I've had the boys at the lab whip up something new: a Teleport Suppression Device! It sets up a passive teleportation disruption field keyed to Trapdoor's DNA signature which disables long-range teleport so he cannot escape again. Our operatives have spotted Crey smuggling him off the island. We've got a boat waiting at the docks. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Intercept the ship and take down Trapdoor once and for all!</A>"
// SendOffString :
"P4021771303" "Analysis of Trapdoor's inherent advanced teleportation abilities can unlock many interesting new developments for Arachnos. You've been given the tools necessary to ensure success in this mission - be sure you catch him this time!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1526169312" "What are you waiting for? Take down Trapdoor!"

